  ],
  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "Mix ingredients except sulfur, adjust pH to 7.0 with NaOH, and autoclave under a N2 atmosphere. After cooling, add the following solutions (autoclaved or *filter-sterilized):"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": "Steam sulfur for 3 hr on each of 3 successive days. Distribute the medium into culture vessels (e.g. 20 ml in 120 ml serum bottles) containing sulfur under a stream of a H2-CO2 (4:1, v/v) gas mixture, and seal with butyl rubber stoppers. Prior to inoculation, add per liter the following solution (autoclaved and stocked under a N2 atmosphere):"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "comment": "Pressurize the inoculated bottles to 200 kPa H2-CO2 (4:1, v/v)."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "comment": ""
    }
  ]
}